  "title": "AIR/GTL SEL｜自身SEL情境札记（项目自编）｜教师自评｜zh-CN v0.1.0",
  "definition": {
    "schemaVersion": 1,
    "pages": [
      {
        "pageKey": "competency_journal_page",
        "title": "自身SEL情境札记",
        "description": "这是一份可跳过任意问题的个人反思记录。它没有分数，不用于判断教学优劣。可以只记录一件事，并选择一个需要支持的小步骤。",
        "questions": [
          {
            "itemKey": "competency_context",
            "type": "SINGLE",
            "prompt": "这次记录主要发生在哪种互动中？",
            "required": false,
            "options": [
              {
                "optionKey": "social_interactions",
                "label": "相处、沟通与课堂秩序"
              },
              {
                "optionKey": "instructional_interactions",
                "label": "任务、讨论与学习支持"
              }
            ],
            "rows": []
          },
          {
            "itemKey": "competency_topic",
            "type": "SINGLE",
            "prompt": "这次想留意自己哪一方面的经历？",
            "required": false,
            "options": [
              {
                "optionKey": "self_awareness",
                "label": "自我觉察"
              },
              {
                "optionKey": "self_management",
                "label": "自我管理与情绪调节"
              },
              {
                "optionKey": "social_awareness",
                "label": "理解他人和情境"
              },
              {
                "optionKey": "relationship_skills",
                "label": "关系与沟通"
              },
              {
                "optionKey": "responsible_decision",
                "label": "负责任的决策"
              }
            ],
            "rows": []
          },
          {
            "itemKey": "competency_situation",
            "type": "LONG_TEXT",
            "prompt": "写下一个你愿意回顾的具体时刻；可以略去人物身份和私人细节。",
            "required": false,
            "options": [],
            "rows": [],
            "maxLength": 1200
          },
          {
            "itemKey": "competency_response",
            "type": "LONG_TEXT",
            "prompt": "当时你注意到自己有什么感受或想法，又作了什么选择？只写你愿意保留的部分。",
            "required": false,
            "options": [],
            "rows": [],
            "maxLength": 1200
          },
          {
            "itemKey": "competency_support",
            "type": "LONG_TEXT",
            "prompt": "有哪些情境条件或支持可能影响了这次经历？你还希望得到什么帮助？",
            "required": false,
            "options": [],
            "rows": [],
            "maxLength": 1200
          },
          {
            "itemKey": "competency_next",
            "type": "LONG_TEXT",
            "prompt": "回到类似情境时，你想保留或小幅调整哪一个做法？",
            "required": false,
            "options": [],
            "rows": [],
            "maxLength": 1200
          }
        ]
      }
    ]
  },
  "statement": "EduK12项目自编的开放式记录与行动模板，借用一般反思流程；没有复制、翻译或逐题改写AIR/GTL原手册题项，不冒充原工具或其短版；待审，无评分。",
